{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12216160","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12216160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1221616001:0":{"text":"おうおう、やっとお目見えか。","source_cn":"回来了回来了，可算是等到人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ABD39A005380D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221616002:0":{"text":"な、何か用ですかい？今日の仕事は全部終わらせやしたぜ……も、もちろん追加の仕事も大歓迎ですぜ！","source_cn":"有……什么事吗？今天的勤务应该都做好了……啊，要是还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD73B880674D85AD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221616003:0":{"text":"ちげえよ、お前たちの今日の仕事ぶりを褒めに来てやったんだ！","source_cn":"咱们兄弟可是专门来找你的。今天的勤务工作做得真是不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9711F487B5F717CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221616004:0":{"text":"すいやせん、すいやせん！以後気を付けますんで……って、褒める？","source_cn":"对不起对不起，我们一定改……诶？你说做得不错？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEFDC80B8A3DDCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221616005:0":{"text":"ああ！さっきギャングどもと一戦交えたところでな、戻ってみてみたら、自分の目を疑ったぜ！","source_cn":"对啊！咱们和水鬼帮干了一架，刚才回来一看，可给咱们乐坏了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD7A8CE12413CD8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221616006:0":{"text":"物は全部綺麗に整頓されてるし、武器もピッカピカ。しかも、アヒルまで捕まえてくれたんだって？","source_cn":"东西摆得整整齐齐，武器擦得闪闪发光。听说你们还去帮忙赶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA02386B3A3E8511","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221616007:0":{"text":"今夜はお前らにも美味い飯を食わせてやるからな！","source_cn":"今天的晚饭得算你们一份功劳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FD280A66638DF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221616008:1":{"text":"え……つまり、わざわざ俺らを褒めに来たと？まさか……","source_cn":"你是说……你们是来夸我们的？真是没想到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE76709BB4ACE2BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221616009:0":{"text":"ははっ、こっちもビックリだぜ。いい仕事ぶりだったぞ！","source_cn":"嗐，我们也没想到啊。你们今天可真是干得漂亮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE24DE2F1A16535C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221616010:0":{"text":"うう……仲間に気にかけてもらえるだけで、俺らも満足でさあ……","source_cn":"哦……要是兄弟们多关心关心我们，我们也满足了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D727910A796F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1221616010":{"text":"うう……仲間に気にかけてもらえるだけで、俺らも満足でさあ……","source_cn":"哦……要是兄弟们多关心关心我们，我们也满足了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D727910A796F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1221616011:0":{"text":"そうだよなあ。今までは戦いに参加しねえやつの分け前は少なめでいいと思ってたが……お前らも頑張ってるんだよな。","source_cn":"可不是，以前觉得你们不打架就该少分钱……唉，其实你们干...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8AD887878297012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1221616012:0":{"text":"このことは明日にでも若頭に報告しておく。","source_cn":"这件事儿得跟上头的人说，明天我们就去找二当家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0969F6EE4D59F3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1221616015:0":{"text":"いやあ、なんていうか……本当に、ありがてえ話だ……","source_cn":"这……这真是，我都不知道怎么说……真是太好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3748E30A68CE859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1221616016:0":{"text":"みんなの見方を変えられただけでも、今日の頑張りは無駄じゃありませんでしたね！","source_cn":"大家能这么想，证明我们没有白干活。太棒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1111ACF8777EE5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"もっと給料を上げてくれ。","source_cn":"该多发点工钱","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3501E98E03247FE1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"もっと給料を上げてくれ。","female":"もっと給料を上げて。","variant_male_record_index":"66222","variant_female_record_index":"66223","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1221616013:0":{"text":"そいつは悪かった。戦うことしか頭にねえ乱暴者ばかりだからよ、どうしても口が悪くなっちまうんだ。","source_cn":"我是个粗人，光会打架，不会讲话，兄弟多担待啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8050FB543C89D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1221616014:0":{"text":"今まで怒鳴ったりしてすまねえな……","source_cn":"怪我们，以前不该对你们这么呼来喝去的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0240D847236E7933","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"もう雑務係を見下すなよ。","source_cn":"得提高些地位","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x397F0D8F86554D70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"もう雑務係を見下すなよ。","female":"もう雑務係を見下さないで。","variant_male_record_index":"66224","variant_female_record_index":"66225","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:血薇帮小头目":{"text":"ブラッディの幹部","source":"血薇帮小头目","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老勤务工雅克":{"text":"年老いた雑務係ヤーク","source":"老勤务工雅克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮打手":{"text":"ブラッディの用心棒","source":"血薇帮打手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮水手":{"text":"ブラッディの水夫","source":"血薇帮水手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"